body:
`ColumnConfig` includes `autoSize` and `groupable`, but `AgGridImpl` only applies `resizable/sortable/filterable`. Either implement these options or remove them from the schema to avoid unused/unsupported configuration surface area.
```suggestion
 *
 * Note: Only properties that are currently applied by the AgGrid implementation
 * are exposed here to avoid unsupported configuration surface area.
 */
export interface ColumnConfig {
  resizable?: boolean;
  sortable?: boolean;
  filterable?: boolean;
```
